:HacpCoreExtractionActivity20260807 a prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "HACP core vocabulary extraction, 2026-08-07"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Extracted 7 classes and 12 properties from energration/patents active/hacp-protocol/hacp.ttl into ontology/hacp-core.ttl, preserving each term's rdfs:label and rdfs:comment verbatim. Excluded: the pat:PatentCandidate root individual, all Claim* and ClaimElement* individuals, all Risk/NoveltyHypothesis/PriorArtReference/TechnicalEmbodiment/PatentArtifact individuals, all specific role/boundary/gate instances (e.g. AIAgentExecutorRole, IrreversibleActionBoundary, ConfidenceThresholdGate), and all pat:*/lim:* properties. These remain in the patent repository as specializations, not part of the neutral protocol vocabulary."@en ;
    prov:generated [ prov:specializationOf :AuditEvidence ;
            prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/energration/patents/blob/93f938d06cca6c2451a7212f0c0845eed71a7afc/active/hacp-protocol/hacp.ttl> ],
